    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "合二大隊 但一小隊二付貳十四伍 外二兵士兵卒役人百十四人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "ごうにだいたい（合わせて二大隊）、ただし一小隊につき二十四伍、ほかに兵士・兵卒・役人百十四人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Combined: 2 battalions; note: each platoon comprises 24 files (伍); in addition, 114 soldiers, troopers, and unit officers. (Hikone military, overflowing right of the Hirado marker; belongs to the previous domain, Hikone.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "歩兵"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
